* official Analog Canvas netlist; PDK X cards rewritten by convert.py
.model nch nmos
.model pch pmos

.subckt dut VDD VSS Vtune Ibias Vout+ Vout-
L1 net3 net2 1n
L2 net5 net3 1n
M1 net2 net5 VDD VDD pch l=0.35 w=112 nf=1 m=1
